## Interface: 16001
## Title: |cff0091edNaowh|r Forever: BiS List
## Notes: Best-in-slot lists, stat weights, Naowh Score, the character panel and the inspect window.
## Author: Naowh
## Version: 1.0.6
## Dependencies: NaowhForever
## Group: NaowhForever
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\NaowhForever\Media\LogoAddon.tga

# Naowh Score: one number for a character's gear, on the item level scale. Its own XML loads
# its files in order (see NaowhScore/README.md).
NaowhScore\NaowhScore.xml

# Stat Weights: what each stat is worth to your spec, for gear tooltips and the BiS List's
# upgrades and enchants (see StatWeights/README.md).
StatWeights\StatWeights.xml

# BiS List: your best-in-slot picks, their window and where they drop (see BiS/README.md).
BiS\BiS.xml

# Character Panel: the game's character panel in the BiS List's look (see
# CharacterPanel/README.md). Loads after BiS, whose lists it shows.
CharacterPanel\CharacterPanel.xml

# Inspect Panel: the game's inspect window in the same look, with a pane for the player inspected
# (see InspectPanel/README.md). Loads after the Character Panel, whose parts it reuses.
InspectPanel\InspectPanel.xml
